<main>

# My Blog

Posts are plain Markdown files in `site/pages/posts/`. This index is one `.wd`
loop over a small JSON manifest — sorted newest-first, shipping zero JavaScript.

@loop /posts.json into post sort by post.date desc
::: post-card
### [{ post.title }]({ post.url })
<p class="post-meta">{ post.date }</p>
{ post.excerpt }
:::
@endloop

</main>
